{"3617990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Star Wrath", "steam_appid": 3617990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist Milestones</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/2e1385ccde51bc62b937eb1623f85a6e.avif?t=1786604437\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras_big/2e1385ccde51bc62b937eb1623f85a6e.webp?t=1786604437 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time Star Wrath is wishlisted, new rewards for the entire community are getting closer. As milestones are reached, new bonuses will be unlocked, and all players will receive rewards after the game releases based on the milestone reached.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For reaching each milestone, all players will receive specific bonuses:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Milestone 1. Credits:</strong> in-game currency used to purchase blueprints, modules, and consumables, as well as to build and equip ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Milestone 2. Avatar:</strong> a unique portrait for your in-game profile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Milestone 3. Special ship:</strong> a unique commemorative ship with excellent combat capabilities for a confident start in the brutal world of Star Wrath!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Milestone 4. Unique appearance for the “Flash” ship:</strong> a unique design for the starter ship to help new Wanderers stand out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Milestone 5. Support resource pack for the early stages of the game:</strong> essential resources that will help all players dive into the relentless battles across the Solar system faster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Star Wrath to your wishlist right now and help unlock all the rewards before release!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Earth has been destroyed. Only the debris floating in space remind us of its former glory. Humanity has lost its home. There are no more flags, no more laws. Only the Echo is left after civilization. And space doesn’t hold salvation; it only demands a price. The lone Wanderers will have to pay it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Wrath is a multiplayer space extraction-action where you design your own ship, fight other space raiders for resources in PvP and PvE session battles and extract the loot you’ve collected from the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with your ship design, improve and adapt it to your play style, but don’t forget about the hull durability and modular destruction. Travel to the outskirts of the solar system to get rare materials, outsmart ruthless opponents and return to safety, if you can. Hide in space nebulae, ambush unsuspecting enemies, and conquer the realistic physics of open space maneuvering. Take on the challenge and fight in a world of lawlessness and brutality where every raid could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/d2c4e91d1c57bc5700c0c4e23fa60215.poster.avif?t=1786604437\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/d2c4e91d1c57bc5700c0c4e23fa60215.webm?t=1786604437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in relentless fights in various corners of the solar system of the future. Fight solo or join other space raiders to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/569f90f17628e01dd3fef33658dd7cc5.poster.avif?t=1786604437\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/569f90f17628e01dd3fef33658dd7cc5.webm?t=1786604437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>From nimble interceptors to heavily armored fighters, assemble your ship from various modules to suit your play style or improve preset blueprints as needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All modules and structural parts are very elaborately designed so that your ship will look nice and realistic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/4c343923e50315c9e95c4d9c40b28356.poster.avif?t=1786604437\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/4c343923e50315c9e95c4d9c40b28356.webm?t=1786604437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every part of your ship can be damaged or destroyed. The hull takes the first hits, but once the core is exposed, survival becomes a real challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/82569dceef9626bf68c9ce5147885b95.poster.avif?t=1786604437\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/82569dceef9626bf68c9ce5147885b95.webm?t=1786604437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use space anomalies to your advantage. Hide from enemy scanners, launch surprise attacks, or disappear into the mist with stolen resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/e6c53f12a8f91756ff7ecfedb74c56c2.poster.avif?t=1786604437\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/e6c53f12a8f91756ff7ecfedb74c56c2.webm?t=1786604437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each pilot has a unique set of skills that can change the course of battle. Harvest DNA samples from the bodies of fallen enemies to get access to their abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/d1311ee486737cf8c79122d860ec0488.poster.avif?t=1786604437\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/d1311ee486737cf8c79122d860ec0488.webm?t=1786604437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mass of your ship, engine types, and modular configurations impact inertia, speed, and maneuverability. Balance firepower, mobility, and armor to suit your combat style.  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Earth has been destroyed. Only the debris floating in space remind us of its former glory. Humanity has lost its home. There are no more flags, no more laws. Only the Echo is left after civilization. And space doesn’t hold salvation; it only demands a price. The lone Wanderers will have to pay it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Wrath is a multiplayer space extraction-action where you design your own ship, fight other space raiders for resources in PvP and PvE session battles and extract the loot you’ve collected from the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with your ship design, improve and adapt it to your play style, but don’t forget about the hull durability and modular destruction. Travel to the outskirts of the solar system to get rare materials, outsmart ruthless opponents and return to safety, if you can. Hide in space nebulae, ambush unsuspecting enemies, and conquer the realistic physics of open space maneuvering. Take on the challenge and fight in a world of lawlessness and brutality where every raid could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/d2c4e91d1c57bc5700c0c4e23fa60215.poster.avif?t=1786604437\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/d2c4e91d1c57bc5700c0c4e23fa60215.webm?t=1786604437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in relentless fights in various corners of the solar system of the future. Fight solo or join other space raiders to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/569f90f17628e01dd3fef33658dd7cc5.poster.avif?t=1786604437\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/569f90f17628e01dd3fef33658dd7cc5.webm?t=1786604437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>From nimble interceptors to heavily armored fighters, assemble your ship from various modules to suit your play style or improve preset blueprints as needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All modules and structural parts are very elaborately designed so that your ship will look nice and realistic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/4c343923e50315c9e95c4d9c40b28356.poster.avif?t=1786604437\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/4c343923e50315c9e95c4d9c40b28356.webm?t=1786604437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every part of your ship can be damaged or destroyed. The hull takes the first hits, but once the core is exposed, survival becomes a real challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/82569dceef9626bf68c9ce5147885b95.poster.avif?t=1786604437\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/82569dceef9626bf68c9ce5147885b95.webm?t=1786604437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use space anomalies to your advantage. Hide from enemy scanners, launch surprise attacks, or disappear into the mist with stolen resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/e6c53f12a8f91756ff7ecfedb74c56c2.poster.avif?t=1786604437\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/e6c53f12a8f91756ff7ecfedb74c56c2.webm?t=1786604437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each pilot has a unique set of skills that can change the course of battle. Harvest DNA samples from the bodies of fallen enemies to get access to their abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/d1311ee486737cf8c79122d860ec0488.poster.avif?t=1786604437\" width=780 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/extras/d1311ee486737cf8c79122d860ec0488.webm?t=1786604437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mass of your ship, engine types, and modular configurations impact inertia, speed, and maneuverability. Balance firepower, mobility, and armor to suit your combat style.  </p>", "short_description": "Star Wrath is a multiplayer space extraction-action where you design your own ship and fight other players for resources in intense PvP and PvE battles.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, German, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/422db369c806788451ac138aebb5210ca8c03e31/header.jpg?t=1786604437", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/4b50ed54e78f4a5a36dc78fa85a490b0e0cc404d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786604437", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617990/4b50ed54e78f4a5a36dc78fa85a490b0e0cc404d/cap